  "Abundant World <color\\=#0F69CB>Lv.$1</color>": "",
  "Deal Fire damage to all foes equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK, and increase Yaoling's Crit Rate by $2 for $3 turns.\\nUpgrade <link\\=\"s|223\"><u>[Fiery Shooting Star]</u></link> for $5 turn: Deal bonus Fire damage equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$4</color> of ATK.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>A huge fireball descends from the sky, and the flames are swept away like a torrent, wishing to burn away the ominous atmosphere in this land.</color></size></b>": "",
  "<size\\=24>Crackling Firecrackers Lv.$1</size>": "",
  "<size\\=24>Crackling Firecrackers <color\\=#0F69CB>Lv.$1</color></size>": "",
  "Deal Fire damage to all foes equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK, with a $2 base chance to inflict <link\\=\"s|102\"><u>Burn</u></link> and [Year Fire] for $3 turns.\\nUpgrade <link\\=\"s|223\"><u>[Fiery Shooting Star]</u></link> for $5 turn: There is a $4 base chance to inflict [Year Fire].\\n[Year Fire]: Take Fire damage equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$6</color> of Yaoling's ATK for $7 turns. Stacks up to $8 times.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>Firecrackers roar like the prelude to the New Year, awakening the dormant earth and engulfing all foes with their flames, causing terrible damage.</color></size></b>": "",
  "<size\\=23>Shooting Star Greetings Lv.$1</size>": "",
  "<size\\=23>Shooting Star Greetings <color\\=#0F69CB>Lv.$1</color></size>": "",
  "Enchant Yaoling's sword and grant her [Iron Flower Dance]: Increase DMG Dealt by <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color>, and Melee Attack evolves to [Fiery Shooting Star]. After activating [Fiery Shooting Star], or at the end of the turn, remove this effect.\\n[Fiery Shooting Star]: Deal Fire damage to all foes equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$3</color> of ATK, and can activate <link\\=\"s|225\"><u>Fire TECHNICAL</u></link>. When <link\\=\"s|226\"><u>Backdraft</u></link> is activated, increase TECHNICAL Effect to $4.\\nThis skill has an initial cooldown time of $5 turn, and after using it, other skills can be used on the same turn (this skill is not treated as a Persona skill).\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>The fire knife draws a dazzling arc, and the unquenchable flame above the blade dances out the incandescent breath of the New Year, bringing a shock that can't be ignored.</color></size></b>": "",
  "[HIGHLIGHT]: Deal Fire damage to all foes equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK. Increase Yaoling's ATK by <color\\=#FFFC40>$2</color> and <link\\=\"s|223\"><u>[Fiery Shooting Star]</u></link> DMG Dealt by <color\\=#FFFC40>$3</color> for $4 turns.\\n[ONE MORE]: Deal Fire damage to 1 foe. \\nMelee Attack: Uses a melee weapon to deal light Phys damage to 1 foe. \\nGun Attack: Deal Gun damage to 1 foe 3 times. Can fire until out of ammo.": "",
  "Increase DMG Dealt to foes inflicted with <link\\=\"s\\|102\"><u>Burn</u></link> by <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color>.": "",
  "Increase DMG Dealt to foes inflicted with <link\\=\"s\\|102\"><u>Burn</u></link> by <color\\=#0169ca>$1</color>.": "",
  "At the start of battle, increase Yaoling's ATK by <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> for $2 turns. When Yaoling or allies activate a TECHNICAL, this effect's duration is reset, and the increase effect becomes <color\\=#FFFC40>$3</color>.": "",
  "At the start of battle, increase Yaoling's ATK by <color\\=#0169ca>$1</color> for $2 turns. When Yaoling or allies activate a TECHNICAL, this effect's duration is reset, and the increase effect becomes <color\\=#0169ca>$3</color>.": "",
  "When [Iron Flower Dance] is active, increase ATK by <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color>. \\nWhen activating a TECHNICAL, increase TECHNICAL Mastery by <color\\=#FFFC40>$2</color>.": "",
  "When [Iron Flower Dance] is active, increase ATK by <color\\=#0169ca>$1</color>. \\nWhen activating a TECHNICAL, increase TECHNICAL Mastery by <color\\=#0169ca>$2</color>.": "",
  "When Yaoling attacks foes with Burn, increase [Fiery Shooting Star] and [Blazing Meteor]'s Skill Damage by <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> + Yaoling's Awareness level * $2.": "",
  "When Yaoling attacks foes with Burn, increase [Fiery Shooting Star] and [Blazing Meteor]'s Skill Damage by <color\\=#0169ca>$1</color> + Yaoling's Awareness level * $2.": "",
  "<color\\=#66ccff>[Fiery Shooting Star]</color>": "",
  "Fiery Shooting Star": "",
  "Unlock when Yaoling is in [Iron Flower Dance], dealing Fire damage to all foes, can activate Fire TECHNICAL. When dealing TECHNICAL to foes inflicted with Burn, increase the TECHNICAL Effect.": "",
