  "Year Fire Farewell": "",
  "Yaoling can enchant her sword and evolve her Melee Attack to <link\\=\"s|223\"><u>[Fiery Shooting Star]</u></link>. When evolved, deal heavy Fire damage to targets, and can activate <link\\=\"s|225\"><u>Fire TECHNICAL</u></link>. When <link\\=\"s|226\"><u>Backdraft</u></link> is activated, increase TECHNICAL Effect to $1.": "",
  "Booming Firecrackers": "",
  "Reduce the first cooldown time for [Shooting Star Greetings] by $1 turn. Extend the duration of <link\\=\"s|222\"><u>[Iron Flower Dance]</u></link> by $2 turn, and <link\\=\"s|223\"><u>[Fiery Shooting Star]</u></link> can be activated up to $3 times. When <link\\=\"s|222\"><u>[Iron Flower Dance]</u></link> is active, upgrade [Abundant World] and [Crackling Firecrackers].\\n[Abundant World]: When upgraded, increase <link\\=\"s|223\"><u>[Fiery Shooting Star]</u></link> Crit DMG by $4.\\n[Crackling Firecrackers]: When upgraded, <link\\=\"s|223\"><u>[Fiery Shooting Star]</u></link> inflicts $5 more <link\\=\"s|224\"><u>[Year Fire]</u></link> stack.": "",
  "Joyous Lanterns": "",
  "When Yaoling is present, for each foe that appears, permanently inflict 1 special limit-breaking <link\\=\"s|102\"><u>Burn</u></link> stack. When this Burn is removed, 1 more stack is immediately inflicted. This effect's cooldown time is $2 turns, calculated individually for each foe.\\nDuring battle, when 1 foe is inflicted with <link\\=\"s|102\"><u>Burn</u></link>, increase Yaoling's Crit Rate by $4. For each additional foe inflicted with <link\\=\"s|102\"><u>Burn</u></link>, increase by $6 more (up to a maximum of $7).": "",
  "Gather Around": "",
  "Joyful Laughter": "",
  "HIGHLIGHT Enhanced: Additionally increase Yaoling's Crit DMG by $1, extend the duration of all buffs gained from this HIGHLIGHT by $2 turns.": "",
  "Melting Ice": "",
  "New Year Afterglow": "",
  "<link\\=\"s|222\"><u>[Iron Flower Dance]</u></link> becomes permanent. <link\\=\"s|223\"><u>[Fiery Shooting Star]</u></link> evolves to [Blazing Meteor], increasing DMG Dealt by $1. <link\\=\"s|222\"><u>[Iron Flower Dance]</u></link> is not removed even after [Blazing Meteor] is activated.\\n[Abundant World] permanently maintains the Crit Rate increase and enhanced effects on [Blazing Meteor].\\nThe duration of [Crackling Firecrackers]'s <link\\=\"s|102\"><u>Burn</u></link> and enhanced effects on [Blazing Meteor] are extended by $2 turn.": "",
  "Deal Fire damage to <color\\=#FFFF00>all</color> foes equal to $1 of ATK, and increase Yaoling's Crit Rate by $2 for $3 turns.\\nUpgrade [Fiery Shooting Star] for $5 turn: Deal bonus Fire damage equal to $4 of ATK.": "",
  "Deal Fire damage to all foes equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK, and increase Yaoling's Crit Rate by $2 for $3 turns.\\nUpgrade <link\\=\"s|223\"><u>[Fiery Shooting Star]</u></link> for $5 turn: Deal bonus Fire damage equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$4</color> of ATK.": "",
